# $project_name

An obox-builder project.

## Dev

```shell
python manage.py runserver --reload
```

With uv, add a local checkout of obox-builder to `pyproject.toml` while the package is not
published on PyPI:

```toml
[tool.uv.sources]
obox-builder = { path = "../obox-builder", editable = true }
```

Then `uv run manage.py runserver` works from a fresh environment.
